{"id":"biolo_gico","lemma":"biológico","pos":"adj","rank":4073,"glosses":["biological, biologic"],"ipa":"/bi.uˈlɔ.ʒi.ku/","forms":{"feminine":"biológica","masculinePlural":"biológicos","femininePlural":"biológicas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Wiktionairy-biol%C3%B3gico.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom é o meu pai biológico.","en":"Tom is my biological father.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"my, mine"},{"g":"father"},null]},{"text":"Tom está procurando pelo pai biológico dele.","en":"Tom's searching for his biological father.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"to search","l":"procurar"},{"g":"by / for the","l":"pelar"},{"g":"father"},null,{"g":"his / of him","l":"delir"}]},{"text":"Penso que Tom tem o direito de conhecer seus pais biológicos.","en":"I think Tom has the right to meet his birth parents.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"tone"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"right (toward the right…"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"their or your kin"},{"g":"parents"},null]},{"text":"Mary não é filha biológica de Tom.","en":"Mary isn't Tom's biological daughter.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"daughter"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"tone"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"isn't it"]]},{"text":"Tom é o pai biológico de Maria.","en":"Tom is Mary's biological father.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"father"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}